:name: STM32F407 Discovery
:description: Loads the stm32-playground firmware. Does not start emulation.

# Paths are relative to the repo root; override them when running from elsewhere.
using sysbus
$repl?=@tests/renode/f407-disco.repl
$elf?=@build/f407/firmware/firmware.elf

mach create "f407"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
"""
runMacro $reset
